  Current usage columns:
    SGA_CUR_GB            Current SGA size (v$sga)
    SHARED_POOL_CUR_GB    Current shared pool (v$sga_dynamic_components)
    DB_CACHE_CUR_GB       Current default buffer cache (v$sga_dynamic_components)
